# direnv integration for the freeq dev env.
#
# With devenv + nix installed, running `direnv allow` once will activate
# the devenv shell automatically whenever you `cd` into this directory.
# See https://devenv.sh/integrations/direnv/ for the full flow.
#
# We use devenv's built-in direnvrc rather than the one bundled with
# upstream direnv so shell startup stays fast on NixOS / non-Nix hosts.

use devenv
